{"4936160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "1 Thousand Deaths", "steam_appid": 4936160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4974260], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>What comes after death? You respawn and try again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore handcrafted worlds.</strong> Forests. Caves. Swamps. Mines. Each zone brings new dangers. Each level brings new traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every prop can be a trap.</strong> A chair to the skull. A table to the face. A bookcase out of nowhere. Props move, spin, launch, fall, appear and disappear. Find the pattern. Dodge. Move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies hide in plain sight.</strong> That chair. That table. That plant. They look like decoration. They fight like monsters. Keep your gun ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4936160/extras/8fdb6422fede1ee210a07bb9047523fe.poster.avif?t=1787726487\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4936160/extras/8fdb6422fede1ee210a07bb9047523fe.webm?t=1787726487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4936160/extras/8fdb6422fede1ee210a07bb9047523fe.mp4?t=1787726487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your tools to find the exit.</strong> Pebble reveals hidden paths. Glowstick guides through darkness. Light cuts through shadows. Dash in any direction. Master your skills. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>What comes after death? You respawn and try again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore handcrafted worlds.</strong> Forests. Caves. Swamps. Mines. Each zone brings new dangers. Each level brings new traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every prop can be a trap.</strong> A chair to the skull. A table to the face. A bookcase out of nowhere. Props move, spin, launch, fall, appear and disappear. Find the pattern. Dodge. Move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies hide in plain sight.</strong> That chair. That table. That plant. They look like decoration. They fight like monsters. Keep your gun ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4936160/extras/8fdb6422fede1ee210a07bb9047523fe.poster.avif?t=1787726487\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4936160/extras/8fdb6422fede1ee210a07bb9047523fe.webm?t=1787726487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4936160/extras/8fdb6422fede1ee210a07bb9047523fe.mp4?t=1787726487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your tools to find the exit.</strong> Pebble reveals hidden paths. Glowstick guides through darkness. Light cuts through shadows. Dash in any direction. Master your skills. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "E